hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2857","Muhammad bin Bashshar narrated to us, saying: Yahya bin Sa'id narrated to us, saying: Ja'far narrated to us, saying: My father narrated to me, saying: We went to Jabir bin Abdullah (RA) and asked him about the Hajj of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ). He said: He stood at Muzdalifah and said, \I stood here"," and all of Muzdalifah is a place of standing (Mawqif).\"""""
"2858","Narrated to us Abdullah bin Sa'id Al-Ashaj, who said: Narrated to us Hafs (meaning Ibn Ghiyath), on the authority of Ja'far, from his father, from Jabir (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) stopped at Jam' (Muzdalifah) and said, \All of Jam' is a place of standing (Mawqif).\"""""
